  "description": "<p>Skylos Collective is an ethical canine atelier, championing sustainable style for our four legged friends.</p>\r\n<p>Our collection of luxury, handcrafted apple leather dog collars, leads and accessories are a must have for the socialite canine.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The collection is artisan produced in rural England, oozing prestigious British quality and is designed for dogs of all sizes who appreciate the finer things in life. We work with a vegan leather, made with waste residues from the Italian apple industry, the material is Peta approved vegan, OEKO-tex and Global Recycled Standard - more information on our product journey, charity donations and eco credentials can be found via our unique product tag QR codes.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://skyloscollective.co.uk\">https://skyloscollective.co.uk</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:Ella@skyloscollective.co.uk\">Ella@skyloscollective.co.uk</a>&nbsp;</p>",
